  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Bobburi Chaitanya vs The State Of Telangana, on 24 September, 2025 Hon'Ble Sri Justice J. Sreenivas Rao Writ Petition No.22504 Of 2017 Order:",
    "facts": "This writ petition has been filed seeking to quash the proceedings in FIR. No.183 of 2016, dated 05.12.2016 on the file of Station House Officer, Mahabubabad(R) Police Station, Mahabubabad District, wherein the petitioner was arrayed as accused No.1, for the offences punishable under Sections 420, 272, 273 read with 34 Indian Penal Code ('IPC' for brevity). 2. Learned Assistant Government Pleader for Home submits that during the pendency of this writ petition, respondent No.2 after conducting investigation transferred the crime to Food Safety Officer, Warangal and the said authority after conducting investigation filed final report before II Additional Junior Civil Judge, Mahabubabad District and the said Court has taken cognizance and the same was numbered as C.C.No.635 of 2019 and JSR, J W.P.No.22504 OF 2017 the same is pending.",
